  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B&amp;B International Music Festival and Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to promote freedom of artistic expression and increase access to arts and culture in Lebanon and the region. The project will seek to empower and develop the independent music scene and the creative economy while encouraging cultural diversity.</narrative>
